# 跨平台换行钉死为 LF。Windows runner 默认 core.autocrlf=true，
# 不写这条的话 checkout 会把源码与锁文件改成 CRLF，锁文件一变形，
# preinstall 里 scripts/audit/wa-sqlite-integrity.mjs 的供应链比对就会误报。
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.wasm binary
